# Narrow line-ending policy: the starter-pack appearance manifest is
# hash-verified against the value recorded in manifest.json.  A CRLF checkout
# (core.autocrlf=true) would change the bytes on disk and fail the public Gate
# on Windows, so this file is pinned to LF on every platform.  Everything else
# follows the repository default.
starter-packs/xiaofei/appearance/pet-xiaofei-animated.json text eol=lf
